# Builder's Talent: "When this Class becomes level 3, return target noncreature, nonland permanent card from your graveyard
# to the battlefield." In turn 9 Bot1's graveyard holds Memnite (a creature card, killed by Bolt), Disenchant (an instant),
# Strip Mine (a land card) and Mox Ruby and Mox Jet (artifact cards, destroyed by Bot2's two Shatters in turn 2); Bot2's
# graveyard holds a Mox Ruby of its own (Disenchant, turn 3). A Mox of Bot1's is targetable: Memnite, Disenchant, Strip Mine
# and Bot2's Mox Ruby are each refused, and Mox Jet returns under Bot1's control. It enters as a noncreature, nonland
# permanent, so the level 2 ability puts a counter on the Wall (the only creature Bot1 has). Four Plains and the Mox Pearl
# pay the {4}{W} of level 3.

